      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_01_00",
      "hash64": "48AFFB7594F6BCD5",
      "text": "要退出隊伍嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_01_01",
      "hash64": "48AFFA7594F6BB22",
      "text": "已退出隊伍！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_01_02",
      "hash64": "48AFF97594F6B96F",
      "text": "要和這些成員一起出發嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_02_00",
      "hash64": "7719798DA1EC3CC2",
      "text": "要解散隊伍嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_msg_03_00",
      "hash64": "1F6D2F86056CE033",
      "text": "還有成員正在做準備。\\n請稍候片刻再出發吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_con_00_00",
      "hash64": "79E59C9EB0672FA5",
      "text": "是",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "oniballoon_matching_con_00_01",
      "hash64": "79E59B9EB0672DF2",
      "text": "否",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_01",
      "hash64": "4B3DD23D885F6D3A",
      "text": "歡迎光臨～！\\n要不要來挑戰打鬼祭啊？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_02",
      "hash64": "4B3DD13D885F6B87",
      "text": "去打鬼打個痛快吧！\\n好，請往這裡來～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_03",
      "hash64": "4B3DD03D885F69D4",
      "text": "歡迎再來玩喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_04",
      "hash64": "4B3DCF3D885F6821",
      "text": "恭喜！初級過關囉！\\n這是首次過關的紀念品，拿去吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_05",
      "hash64": "4B3DCE3D885F666E",
      "text": "如果是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的話，\\n挑戰中級的打鬼祭應該也不成問題！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_06",
      "hash64": "4B3DCD3D885F64BB",
      "text": "恭喜！中級過關囉！\\n這是首次過關的紀念品，拿去吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_07",
      "hash64": "4B3DCC3D885F6308",
      "text": "如果是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的話，\\n挑戰高級的打鬼祭應該也不成問題！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08",
      "hash64": "4B3DCB3D885F6155",
      "text": "恭喜！高級過關囉！\\n這般好成績可是難得一見呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_2",
      "hash64": "925FF7862C6613A4",
      "text": "如果是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的話，\\n我應該能放心託付那隻寶可夢……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_3",
      "hash64": "925FF8862C661557",
      "text": "每次舉辦打鬼祭的時候，\\n都會吸引來一隻\\r\\n貪吃的小卡比獸。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_4",
      "hash64": "925FF5862C66103E",
      "text": "牠實在太貪吃了，每次牠一來，\\n打鬼祭的難度就會變高……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_5",
      "hash64": "925FF6862C6611F1",
      "text": "……事情就是這樣！\\n讓我把那隻小卡比獸託付給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_08_6",
      "hash64": "925FF3862C660CD8",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]受大姐姐\\n託付了一隻小卡比獸！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "oniballoon_entrynpc_09",
      "hash64": "4B3DCA3D885F5FA2",
      "text": "……唉呀！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的盒子滿了呢。\\r\\n先去整理好再來找我吧！",
      "flags": 0,
